Dear Jacob,

Many graphics functions, such as lines(), points(), and text(), are 
designed to add elements to an existing plot. In contrast, high-level 
plotting functions, such as plot(), generally clear a device before 
plotting. You can prevent the device from being cleared by the command 
par(new=TRUE). See help(par) for details.

I hope that this helps,
 John

