From sundar.dorai-raj at pdf.com  Fri Feb  7 21:10:47 2003
From: sundar.dorai-raj at pdf.com (Sundar Dorai-Raj)
Date: Fri, 07 Feb 2003 15:10:47 -0600
Subject: Re: Residuals from fiting an ARIMA
